{"speciesId":590,"names":{"fr":"Trompignon","es":"Foongus","en":"Foongus","ja":"タマゲタケ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Grâce à sa ressemblance mystérieuse avec une Poké Ball, il attire ses ennemis et relâche des spores empoisonnées."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It lures people in with its Poké Ball pattern, then releases poison spores. Why it resembles a Poké Ball is unknown."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Pour une raison inconnue, il ressemble à une Poké Ball. Il repousse ses ennemis à l’aide de spores empoisonnées."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"For some reason, this Pokémon resembles a Poké Ball. They release poison spores to repel those who try to catch them."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It lures Pokémon with its pattern that looks just like a Poké Ball then releases poison spores."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It lures Pokémon with its pattern that looks just like a Poké Ball then releases poison spores."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Grâce à sa ressemblance mystérieuse avec une Poké Ball, il attire ses ennemis et relâche des spores empoisonnées."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Gracias a su misterioso parecido a una Poké Ball, atrae a sus presas y lanza rápidamente esporas de veneno."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It lures people in with its Poké Ball pattern, then releases poison spores. Why it resembles a Poké Ball is unknown."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"モンスターボールに 似た 模様で 誘い 毒胞子を 吹きかける。 なぜ 似ているかは ナゾである。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son apparence de Poké Ball trompe ses ennemis, qu’il étourdit à l’aide de ses spores empoisonnées."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Atraen a otros Pokémon gracias a su similitud con una Poké Ball y los atacan expulsando esporas venenosas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It lures Pokémon with its pattern that looks just like a Poké Ball, then releases poison 